OL,3,AProtesters start fires and clash with
OL,4,Apolice as school demonstrations spread
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere are protests in more than 30
OL,8,Ftowns and cities, according to L'Union
OL,9,FEtudiante. In Strasbourg, there were
OL,10,Fscuffles between police and protesters,
OL,11,Fwhile in Lyon, a barricade was set on
OL,12,Ffire
OL,14,FIn Lille, bins were set on fire,
OL,15,Freports Nick Beake - while a student in
OL,16,FParis tells Hugh Schofield: "I am very
OL,17,Fscared for the future"
OL,19,FIn the past week, students have
OL,20,Fblockaded hundreds of schools with at
OL,21,Fleast 215 injured and more than 5,000
OL,22,Fpeople arrested
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
